{"availability":"available","full":"hendurhance/whispr","name":"whispr","description":"An open-source anonymous Q&A platform that lets anyone send you questions, compliments, honest feedback and more without revealing their identity It's up to you to cause chaos or spread love.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":8,"forks":2,"created":"2023-12-11T07:26:26Z","updated":"2026-06-10T14:46:29Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://trywhispr.me","topics":["anonymous","collaborate","github-copilot","messaging","react","supabase","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://trywhispr.me/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T09:44:06.988Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T09:44:06.988Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T09:44:06.988Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T09:44:06.988Z","stars":8,"forks":2}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The open-source way to collect anonymous questions, confessions, roasts and honest feedback. Share your link, find out what people really think, and turn the best replies into a share card.","An open-source alternative to NGL, Sarahah and Kubool.","Whispr is an open-source, privacy-first alternative to anonymous-messaging apps like NGL, Sarahah and Kubool. Claim a username, share one link (trywhispr.me/), and anyone — no account needed — can send you anonymous questions, confessions, roasts, compliments or honest feedback. You read everything in a private inbox and answer the best ones by posting a printed-zine share card to your socials. No public comment wall, no fake metrics, no dark patterns."],"features":["Anonymous messages, nine ways — questions, compliments, roasts, confessions, dares, secrets, hot takes, suggestions and rumors. Senders stay anonymous; you read it all in a private inbox.","One shareable link — trywhispr.me/, drop it in a bio or story.","Share cards (the viral loop) — turn any whispr into an editorial share card (story / square / OG sizes) rendered server-side with next/og, with one-tap share to Instagram / TikTok / X, a QR code, and PNG download. There…","Near-real-time inbox — the dashboard polls for new whisprs and surfaces them instantly, with filters by type and read/unread state.","Installable PWA — add to home screen, offline fallback, app-icon unread badge, and Web Push notifications when a new whispr lands."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hendurhance/whispr/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"958c89e46757532916483e0f574dd00cb6c28bd4d8f62ec54a7d034670d25f49","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T09:44:07.259Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T09:44:07.259Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The open-source way to collect anonymous questions, confessions, roasts and honest feedback. Share your link, find out what people really think, and turn the best replies into a share card.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hendurhance/whispr/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"Claim a username, share one link (trywhispr.me/), and anyone — no account needed — can send you anonymous questions, confessions, roasts, compliments or honest feedback.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hendurhance/whispr/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Passwordless login — magic-link email, no passwords.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hendurhance/whispr/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"958c89e46757532916483e0f574dd00cb6c28bd4d8f62ec54a7d034670d25f49","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hendurhance/whispr/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T09:44:07.259Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-06-10T14:46:29Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hendurhance/whispr/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T09:44:07.260Z","hash":"958c89e46757532916483e0f574dd00cb6c28bd4d8f62ec54a7d034670d25f49","originalBytes":10719,"storedBytes":10719,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["public",